[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="MachineSpecies" format=3]
; Nirvanary (SwoopBehavior), the last boss, a placeholder until the character pass: what the machines call paradise,
; waiting at the Heart. It drifts high and wide over the pilgrim, stops and shudders, then dives through where the
; pilgrim stands, faster than the Archivist; every fourth dive it turns and dives again at once. It hangs low and still
; after a dive (the opening).

